config-connector-extensions patch 0054: mockgcp's compute patches (the
JSON merge patch of mergeProtos) replace every scalar field, not only
strings.

ComputeServiceAttachmentFields (compute.gcp.hfl.dev, docs/design.md
decision 37) patches a service attachment's reconcileConnections (a bool)
and propagatedConnectionLimit (a uint32); mergeProtos answered 500
"unhandled kind for field" for any scalar but a string, so no patch
could set either (nor enableProxyProtocol). Each scalar is now replaced,
as a string was. Upstream candidate: yes.

diff --git a/mockgcp/mockcompute/regionalserviceattachmentv1.go b/mockgcp/mockcompute/regionalserviceattachmentv1.go
index d7b0fd2..c09f039 100644
--- a/mockgcp/mockcompute/regionalserviceattachmentv1.go
+++ b/mockgcp/mockcompute/regionalserviceattachmentv1.go
@@ -207,7 +207,14 @@ func mergeProtos(dst protoreflect.Message, src protoreflect.Message) error {
 			errs = append(errs, fmt.Errorf("unhandled list for field %v: %v", fd, fd.Kind()))
 		} else {
 			switch fd.Kind() {
-			case protoreflect.StringKind:
+			case protoreflect.StringKind,
+				// Every other scalar is replaced, as a string is
+				// (reconcileConnections, propagatedConnectionLimit,
+				// enableProxyProtocol).
+				protoreflect.BoolKind, protoreflect.EnumKind,
+				protoreflect.Int32Kind, protoreflect.Int64Kind,
+				protoreflect.Uint32Kind, protoreflect.Uint64Kind,
+				protoreflect.FloatKind, protoreflect.DoubleKind:
 				dst.Set(fd, srcVal)
 			default:
 				errs = append(errs, fmt.Errorf("unhandled kind for field %v: %v", fd, fd.Kind()))
